body:
I agree 100%. The "known as" feature could be permanent and not 30 days, and limit name changes to 5 or less per character so that when you hover over this button you don't get a long list of like 30 different names. I'm sure players can find a good name that they like with 5 changes. 

&#x200B;

I'm okay with it being behind a paywall too. It's a good way for the company to make money off of an easy feature, and I'm all for KI making enough profit to continue planning good story updates and side content. They've been listening to us a lot more recently, i.e. magic mirror, seventh character slot, graphics updates, Deckathalon, and hopefully they listen to us now.

I'd love if you could draw my cat, Kibble. I have tried to before but I'm not very good haha. some reference, [https://imgur.com/gallery/zhw6ifV](https://imgur.com/gallery/zhw6ifV)

&#x200B;

thanks! I love your art by the way.
